{"seq":2,"slug":"repaired-reexport-writeoff","title":"维修后复出口与进境账册核销","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-maintenance-repair-reexport/entry-reexport-writeoff/repaired-reexport-writeoff","wordCount":2069,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"维修后复出口与进境账册核销\">维修后复出口与进境账册核销</h1><p>一台设备修好了，怎么证明它真的出去了？这句话问的是核销的本质。核销不是把数字算平，而是<strong>证明承诺被兑现</strong>：一年前进境时说&quot;我会让这批货复运出境&quot;，现在需要拿出证据说明每一台都出去了、或者说明了为什么没出去。核销周期就是给这个承诺设的期限，而核销动作就是期限到来时的清账。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>监管规则对核销周期给出了一条原则加一条例外：<strong>原则上最长不超过 1 年</strong>；飞机、船舶等大型装备维修企业经主管海关确认，可以<strong>按合同实际有效期</strong>确定（<a href=\"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2018-12/31/content_5447554.htm\">海关总署公告2018年第203号</a>）。这条例外不是宽松，而是承认现实——一艘船的坞修周期本身就是数月量级，用一年的通用窗口去套会把核销切在维修中途。</p>\n<p>核销的输入有三个来源：<strong>进境记录</strong>（待维修货物底账的期初数）、<strong>耗用记录</strong>（工单驱动的料件扣减）、以及<strong>处置记录</strong>（复出境、内销、销毁三类去向凭证）。核销的输出是一份把期初数分解到各期末状态的对照：多少台修好出境、多少台判定不可修、多少料件随整机出境、多少料件补税、多少边角料复出。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[期初&lt;br/&gt;待维修底账] --&gt; B[维修周期]&#10;  B --&gt; C{期末处置}&#10;  C --&gt;|修复| D[已维修底账]&#10;  C --&gt;|不可修| E[无法维修底账]&#10;  D --&gt; F[复运出境申报]&#10;  E --&gt; G[复运出境或销毁]&#10;  F --&gt; H[核销清单]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  I[料件底账] --&gt; J[工单耗用汇总]&#10;  J --&gt; H&#10;  K[边角料/旧件] --&gt; L[处置凭证]&#10;  L --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; M{账面平衡?}&#10;  M --&gt;|是| N[核销通过]&#10;  M --&gt;|否| O[差异归因&lt;br/&gt;转盘点核查]\">graph TD\n  A[期初&lt;br/&gt;待维修底账] --&gt; B[维修周期]\n  B --&gt; C{期末处置}\n  C --&gt;|修复| D[已维修底账]\n  C --&gt;|不可修| E[无法维修底账]\n  D --&gt; F[复运出境申报]\n  E --&gt; G[复运出境或销毁]\n  F --&gt; H[核销清单]\n  G --&gt; H\n  I[料件底账] --&gt; J[工单耗用汇总]\n  J --&gt; H\n  K[边角料/旧件] --&gt; L[处置凭证]\n  L --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; M{账面平衡?}\n  M --&gt;|是| N[核销通过]\n  M --&gt;|否| O[差异归因&lt;br/&gt;转盘点核查]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>核销要素</th>\n<th>期初口径</th>\n<th>期末口径</th>\n<th>匹配键</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>待维修货物</td>\n<td>进境申报数量</td>\n<td>已维修 + 无法维修 + 在修</td>\n<td>序列号 / 申报项号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已维修货物</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>复出境数量</td>\n<td>序列号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无法维修货物</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>复出境或销毁数量</td>\n<td>序列号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保税料件</td>\n<td>备案进口量</td>\n<td>耗用 + 结转 + 剩余</td>\n<td>料号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边角料旧件</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>复出 + 内销 + 销毁</td>\n<td>副产物编号</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"复出口的申报动作\">复出口的申报动作</h2><h3 id=\"已修复货物的出境申报\">已修复货物的出境申报</h3><p>已修复货物的出境申报要素与进境对称：仍用<strong>保税维修（1371）</strong>，品名换成&quot;<strong>货物品名（已修复）</strong>&quot;，数量按实际修复完成的台数。这种对称设计的价值在于<strong>进出对应关系可以用简单的键匹配实现</strong>——同一个序列号在进境申报里是待修复、在出境申报里是已修复，账册只需按序列号做集合差。</p>\n<p>但对称性有一个容易被破坏的地方：<strong>返修后的货物不一定原路返回</strong>。委托架构那一章提到过&quot;复出境收货人是否应与进境发货人一致&quot;的取舍。若允许直发最终用户，那么进出申报的收货人字段不一致，纯粹按收货人做匹配就会失败。因此匹配键应当是<strong>序列号而非收发主体</strong>，收发主体的偏离只作为异常标记而不是匹配失败。</p>\n<h3 id=\"无法修复货物的处置\">无法修复货物的处置</h3><p>无法修复货物在核销中的处理最为敏感，因为它是&quot;承诺未兑现&quot;的唯一合法出口。规则要求它原则上复运出境；确实无法出境的，不得内销，应按规定销毁。核销时需要为每一台无法修复货物提供二选一的凭证：<strong>复出境申报单</strong>或<strong>销毁处置凭证</strong>。两者都没有的，就是核销差异。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 核销清单：按期初序列号分解到各期末状态&#10;WITH entry AS (&#10;  SELECT unnest(serial_nos) AS serial_no, decl_id&#10;  FROM repair_entry_declaration&#10;  WHERE declared_at &gt;= $cycle_start AND declared_at &lt; $cycle_end&#10;),&#10;fixed AS (&#10;  SELECT serial_no FROM repair_work_order&#10;  WHERE conclusion = &#39;FIXED&#39; AND completed_at &lt; $cycle_end&#10;),&#10;unfixed AS (&#10;  SELECT serial_no FROM repair_work_order&#10;  WHERE conclusion = &#39;UNREPAIRABLE&#39; AND completed_at &lt; $cycle_end&#10;),&#10;shipped AS (&#10;  SELECT unnest(serial_nos) AS serial_no FROM repair_reexport_declaration&#10;  WHERE declared_at &lt; $cycle_end&#10;)&#10;SELECT e.serial_no,&#10;       CASE&#10;         WHEN s.serial_no IS NOT NULL THEN &#39;REEXPORTED&#39;&#10;         WHEN f.serial_no IS NOT NULL THEN &#39;FIXED_NOT_SHIPPED&#39;&#10;         WHEN u.serial_no IS NOT NULL THEN &#39;UNREPAIRABLE&#39;&#10;         ELSE &#39;IN_PROGRESS&#39;&#10;       END AS end_state&#10;FROM entry e&#10;LEFT JOIN shipped s USING (serial_no)&#10;LEFT JOIN fixed   f USING (serial_no)&#10;LEFT JOIN unfixed u USING (serial_no);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 核销清单：按期初序列号分解到各期末状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> entry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unnest(serial_nos) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> serial_no, decl_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repair_entry_declaration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> declared_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $cycle_start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> declared_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $cycle_end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">fixed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> serial_no </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repair_work_order</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> conclusion </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'FIXED'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> completed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $cycle_end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">unfixed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> serial_no </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repair_work_order</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> conclusion </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'UNREPAIRABLE'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> completed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $cycle_end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">shipped </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unnest(serial_nos) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> serial_no </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repair_reexport_declaration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> declared_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $cycle_end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">serial_no</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">serial_no</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'REEXPORTED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">serial_no</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'FIXED_NOT_SHIPPED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">serial_no</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'UNREPAIRABLE'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'IN_PROGRESS'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> end_state</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> entry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shipped s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (serial_no)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fixed   f </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (serial_no)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unfixed u </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (serial_no);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段查询的输出直接就是核销差异清单：<code>FIXED_NOT_SHIPPED</code> 是修好但没出境的，这是最需要解释的一类——它要么是还在等物流，要么是被截留了。<code>IN_PROGRESS</code> 是仍在修的正常在制品，只要在核销周期内就不构成问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"料件侧的核销\">料件侧的核销</h2><h3 id=\"据实核销的汇总口径\">据实核销的汇总口径</h3><p>料件核销的依据是工单耗用汇总，这在第 2 章已经建立。核销期的料件平衡式是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>进口</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>耗用</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>结转</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>剩余</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>差异</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{进口}} = Q_{\\text{耗用}} + Q_{\\text{结转}} + Q_{\\text{剩余}} + Q_{\\text{差异}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">进口</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">耗用</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">结转</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">剩余</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">差异</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>四项中，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>耗用</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{耗用}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">耗用</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 来自工单，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>结转</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{结转}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">结转</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>剩余</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{剩余}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">剩余</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 来自余料处理单，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>进口</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{进口}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">进口</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 来自料件底账的期初值。理论上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>差异</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{差异}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">差异</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 应为零，实践中它总是有值——<strong>核销工作的重点不是把差异清零，而是让差异可解释</strong>。规则对差异处理给出了明确方向：保税进口的剩余料件可按加工贸易边角料、剩余料件等管理办法处置；余料结转有专门的申报代码（0657 或 0258）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"结转与补税的分界\">结转与补税的分界</h3><p>料件留在账册里有三种结局：随整机复运出境（最常见的无形出口）、结转到下一核销周期、以及补税内销。三者的分界取决于业务判断而非自动规则——比如一批料件是否还有后续订单，是生意问题而不是监管问题。系统要做的是把<strong>三种结局都做成显式动作</strong>，任何料件都不得在核销时&quot;消失&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>料件结局</th>\n<th>申报代码</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>税务后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>随整机复运出境</td>\n<td>随 1371 出境</td>\n<td>已装入修复货物</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>余料结转</td>\n<td>0657 / 0258</td>\n<td>下周期继续使用</td>\n<td>无（延续保税）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复运出境（料件形态）</td>\n<td>0664 / 0265</td>\n<td>不再需要且可退运</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>征税内销</td>\n<td>按进口管理规定</td>\n<td>政策允许且取得许可</td>\n<td>补缴关税与进口环节税</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"核销的时点约束\">核销的时点约束</h2><h3 id=\"集中申报与年度窗口\">集中申报与年度窗口</h3><p>核销不是孤立动作，它嵌套在申报节奏里。区内企业应当在每季度结束的次月 15 日前办理该季度货物集中申报手续，且办理时间&quot;不得晚于账册核销截止日期，<strong>不得跨年度办理</strong>&quot;（<a href=\"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2022-03/30/content_5682479.htm\">《中华人民共和国海关综合保税区管理办法》第二十四条</a>）。&quot;不得跨年度&quot;是一条硬约束，它把跨年的待申报业务直接排除在外——这意味着每年年末前必须清掉当期的集中申报积压。</p>\n<h3 id=\"核销前的三项检查\">核销前的三项检查</h3><p>把核销做成一套可执行的前置检查，比事后解释差异便宜得多。三项检查按依赖顺序排列：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;writeoff_precheck&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;order&quot;: 1,&#10;      &quot;check&quot;: &quot;open_work_orders&quot;,&#10;      &quot;rule&quot;: &quot;核销周期内不得存在未关闭工单，或已按原因拆分为两段&quot;,&#10;      &quot;blocking&quot;: true&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;order&quot;: 2,&#10;      &quot;check&quot;: &quot;byproduct_disposed&quot;,&#10;      &quot;rule&quot;: &quot;每件副产物必须有处置路由与凭证&quot;,&#10;      &quot;blocking&quot;: true&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;order&quot;: 3,&#10;      &quot;check&quot;: &quot;material_movement_mapped&quot;,&#10;      &quot;rule&quot;: &quot;每笔料件移动有唯一申报代码映射&quot;,&#10;      &quot;blocking&quot;: true&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;order&quot;: 4,&#10;      &quot;check&quot;: &quot;guarantee_exposure&quot;,&#10;      &quot;rule&quot;: &quot;核销后敞口释放，担保额度回收&quot;,&#10;      &quot;blocking&quot;: false&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"writeoff_precheck\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"order\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"check\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"open_work_orders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"核销周期内不得存在未关闭工单，或已按原因拆分为两段\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"blocking\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"order\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"check\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"byproduct_disposed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"每件副产物必须有处置路由与凭证\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"blocking\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"order\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"check\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"material_movement_mapped\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"每笔料件移动有唯一申报代码映射\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"blocking\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"order\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"check\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"guarantee_exposure\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"核销后敞口释放，担保额度回收\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"blocking\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>前三项设为 <code>blocking</code> 的理由是它们各自对应一类可在核销前消灭的差异源。第四项不阻断核销，但必须执行——担保敞口的释放是核销的直接财务后果，忘了释放会让企业在下一周期无谓地占用额度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"核销与周期的滚动关系\">核销与周期的滚动关系</h3><p>核销一个周期同时开启下一个周期。这种滚动关系要求账册结构支持<strong>周期维度</strong>，而不是简单地在同一批记录上累加。可行的做法是给每条账册记录标注所属核销周期，期末核销时按周期切片，上期未了结的事项（在修货物、结转料件）自动成为下期期初。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE ledger_cycle_snapshot (&#10;  cycle_id       text PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  book_id        text NOT NULL REFERENCES repair_ledger_book(book_id),&#10;  cycle_start    date NOT NULL,&#10;  cycle_end      date NOT NULL,&#10;  opening_qty    jsonb NOT NULL,              -- 按期初各科目&#10;  movement       jsonb NOT NULL,              -- 本期进出与耗用汇总&#10;  closing_qty    jsonb NOT NULL,&#10;  variance       jsonb NOT NULL,              -- 差异及归因&#10;  writeoff_status text NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;OPEN&#39;,&#10;  CONSTRAINT chk_cycle_status CHECK (&#10;    writeoff_status IN (&#39;OPEN&#39;,&#39;SUBMITTED&#39;,&#39;ACCEPTED&#39;,&#39;VARIANCE_PENDING&#39;))&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ledger_cycle_snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cycle_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  book_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repair_ledger_book(book_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cycle_start    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cycle_end      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  opening_qty    jsonb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 按期初各科目</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  movement       jsonb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 本期进出与耗用汇总</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  closing_qty    jsonb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  variance       jsonb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 差异及归因</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  writeoff_status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'OPEN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chk_cycle_status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    writeoff_status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'OPEN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SUBMITTED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ACCEPTED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'VARIANCE_PENDING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>variance</code> 字段保留差异而不只是汇总，这一点与&quot;核销不是清零而是可解释&quot;的原则一致。差异数据是下一章盘点与核查的输入——<strong>核销发现的问题，最终要靠盘点落地归因</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>核销的本质是证明复出境承诺被兑现，而不是把数字算平；核销周期原则最长 1 年，大型装备可按合同有效期确定。</li>\n<li>复出口申报与进境对称：仍用 1371，品名换成&quot;已修复&quot;；匹配键应是序列号而非收发主体，以容纳直发客户等合理偏离。</li>\n<li>无法修复货物每台都必须有二选一的凭证（复出境单或销毁凭证），两者皆无即为核销差异。</li>\n<li>料件核销依据工单耗用汇总，平衡式中差异不应被强行清零，而应可解释；剩余料件有结转、退运、补税三条显式结局。</li>\n<li>核销嵌套在集中申报节奏里，受&quot;不得跨年度办理&quot;约束；核销前应做四项检查，其中三项阻断性检查对应可提前消灭的差异源。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一篇 <a href=\"bonded-repair-tax-treatment\">保税维修关税/增值税待遇与内销红线</a> 把整条时间轴收束到税务口径上，讲清三种处置路径各自的税负与红线。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"维修后复出口与进境账册核销","id":"维修后复出口与进境账册核销"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"复出口的申报动作","id":"复出口的申报动作"},{"level":3,"text":"已修复货物的出境申报","id":"已修复货物的出境申报"},{"level":3,"text":"无法修复货物的处置","id":"无法修复货物的处置"},{"level":2,"text":"料件侧的核销","id":"料件侧的核销"},{"level":3,"text":"据实核销的汇总口径","id":"据实核销的汇总口径"},{"level":3,"text":"结转与补税的分界","id":"结转与补税的分界"},{"level":2,"text":"核销的时点约束","id":"核销的时点约束"},{"level":3,"text":"集中申报与年度窗口","id":"集中申报与年度窗口"},{"level":3,"text":"核销前的三项检查","id":"核销前的三项检查"},{"level":3,"text":"核销与周期的滚动关系","id":"核销与周期的滚动关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"进境维修货物申报与担保","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-maintenance-repair-reexport/entry-reexport-writeoff/repair-goods-entry-declaration"},"next":{"title":"保税维修关税/增值税待遇与内销红线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-maintenance-repair-reexport/entry-reexport-writeoff/bonded-repair-tax-treatment"}}